    <briefdescription>
<para>Slope-weighted FBM layering function class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Modulates higher-octave amplitude by the accumulated low-frequency gradient norm so that flat areas remain smooth while steep slopes develop rugosity. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
